= The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> Rejoins Government

The Serannus Plan has been ratified, and the controversy surrounding it has largely subsided, prompting the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> to rejoin the cabinet it had previously abandoned. Their primary motivation for reentering the government is their fear of <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformist</span> influence over Askew's policies due to our toleration of Askew’s administration. As a result, Askew no longer depends on our votes.

- @center_right_coalition

@center_right_coalition
title: The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> replaces us in government.
on-arrival: marcher_toleration = 0; in_right_coalition = 0; in_center_right_coalition = 1

There is nothing more to be done. The chance to shape this outcome has passed us by.